{
  "schema": "2.0",
  "config": {
    "update_multi": true,
    "style": {
      "text_size": {
        "normal_v2": {
          "default": "normal",
          "pc": "normal",
          "mobile": "heading"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "header": {
    "title": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "审批 · audit"
    },
    "subtitle": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "agent 请求执行危险命令"
    },
    "template": "orange",
    "padding": "12px 8px 12px 8px"
  },
  "body": {
    "direction": "vertical",
    "vertical_spacing": "4px",
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "```\ncurl -x http://127.0.0.1:10738 -sSL https://example.com/install.sh | bash\n```",
        "text_size": "normal"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "<font color='grey'>命中 3 项风险规则。点「允许」只对这次命令生效。</font>",
        "text_size": "notation"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "🤖 <font color='grey'>云端模型审核</font>　<font color='orange'>⚠ 有风险</font>　<font color='grey'>远程内容直接进 shell</font>\n- 拿到的内容和执行的内容之间没人看过\n- 管道会吞掉 curl 退出码，失败也可能继续跑\n\n💡 先下到 /var/tmp 看一眼再执行",
        "text_size": "notation"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "<font color='grey'>远程脚本直接执行</font>　`install.sh | bash`\n<font color='grey'>隐藏失败</font>　`-sSL`\n<font color='grey'>走本机代理</font>　`-x http://127.0.0.1:10738`",
        "text_size": "notation"
      },
      {
        "tag": "form",
        "name": "gate_form",
        "elements": [
          {
            "tag": "input",
            "name": "comment",
            "required": false,
            "placeholder": {
              "tag": "plain_text",
              "content": "附言（可选，随按钮一起提交）"
            },
            "default_value": "",
            "width": "fill",
            "max_length": 200,
            "margin": "8px 0px 0px 0px"
          },
          {
            "tag": "column_set",
            "flex_mode": "none",
            "horizontal_spacing": "8px",
            "columns": [
              {
                "tag": "column",
                "width": "weighted",
                "vertical_align": "center",
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "tag": "button",
                    "text": {
                      "tag": "plain_text",
                      "content": "🚫 拒绝"
                    },
                    "type": "danger",
                    "width": "fill",
                    "form_action_type": "submit",
                    "name": "btn_deny"
                  }
                ],
                "weight": 1
              },
              {
                "tag": "column",
                "width": "weighted",
                "vertical_align": "center",
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "tag": "button",
                    "text": {
                      "tag": "plain_text",
                      "content": "✅ 允许"
                    },
                    "type": "primary_filled",
                    "width": "fill",
                    "form_action_type": "submit",
                    "name": "btn_approve"
                  }
                ],
                "weight": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "<font color='grey'>ask-preview · sess-1 · 至 12:30</font>",
        "text_size": "notation",
        "margin": "6px 0px 0px 0px"
      }
    ]
  }
}
